2. In this Act unless the context otherwise requires—

"the Buffer Stock" means the Buffer Stock established
under Article 20 of the International Tin Agreement, 1971;

"Minister" means the Minister for the time being charged
with responsibility for finance;

"the Fourth Buffer Stock" means the Buffer Stock to be
established under Article 20 of the International Tin
Agreement, 1971;

"tin concentrates" has the meaning assigned to the term
by the Tin Control Ordinance, 1954.
